cff-version: 1.2.0
title: linx_cobaya
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it together with LINX, Cobaya, and
  whichever Boltzmann code you ran (CAMB or CLASS). See references below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lodha
    given-names: Kushal
    email: klodha@bu.edu
    affiliation: Boston University
repository-code: https://github.com/Kushallodha/linx_cobaya
abstract: >-
  A Cobaya Theory component that replaces a Boltzmann code's static BBN
  interpolation table with a live LINX nuclear-network solve, supplying YHe and
  the final N_eff to CAMB or CLASS as input parameters and Y_p and D/H to a BBN
  abundance likelihood.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - cosmology
  - big bang nucleosynthesis
  - cosmic microwave background
  - Bayesian inference
